  "id": "indian-style-okra",
  "name": "Indian-Style Okra",
  "subtitle": "Tender okra with warm spices and onion",
  "description": "Sautéed okra and onion are seasoned with cumin, ginger, coriander, pepper, and salt for a simple Indian-inspired side.",
